{"suttaId":"sn45.36","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-v","vriCode":"s0305m.mul","paras":[153,153],"vripara":"36"},"segments":{"sn45.36:0.3":"Dutiyasāmaññasuttaṃ","sn45.36:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn45.36:1.2":"“Sāmaññañca vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi, sāmaññatthañca.","sn45.36:1.3":"Taṃ suṇātha.","sn45.36:1.4":"Katamañca kho, bhikkhave, sāmaññaṃ?","sn45.36:1.5":"Ayameva ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo, seyyathidaṃ – sammādiṭṭhi … pe … sammāsamādhi.","sn45.36:1.7":"Idaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, sāmaññaṃ.","sn45.36:1.8":"Katamo ca, bhikkhave, sāmaññattho?","sn45.36:1.9":"Yo kho, bhikkhave, rāgakkhayo dosakkhayo mohakkhayo – ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, sāmaññattho”ti.","sn45.36:1.11":"Chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
